00:39:47,084 --> 00:39:54,384
But if you're in a bad position, just get out. Don't turn a bad position into an even worse position.

699
00:39:54,484 --> 00:39:55,284
Just get out.

700
00:39:56,184 --> 00:40:01,484
I don't want to say cut your losses short. That sounds very cliche, but don't overstay a bad position.

701
00:40:01,584 --> 00:40:05,184
If it's not working out, cut it before it becomes a bigger problem.

702
00:40:05,284 --> 00:40:06,084
It's like cancer.

703
00:40:06,684 --> 00:40:09,484
If you catch it early, you can prevent it.

704
00:40:09,684 --> 00:40:14,784
You catch it late, well, unfortunately, that's not good for you.

